        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "key_insights",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## Key Insights\n",
                "\n",
                "**1. Electronics drives over half of all revenue, but Accessories sells the most units.**\n",
                "Electronics generated **$1.51M (50.6%)** of total recognised revenue from 33,506 units, while Accessories sold **35,031 units** (the highest volume) but contributed only **$481K (16.1%)**. The shop depends on high-value electronics items for revenue, while accessories drive customer volume.\n",
                "\n",
                "**2. Revenue was stable for two years, then dropped sharply in 2026.**\n",
                "Monthly revenue held steady at **$95K–$113K** from January 2024 through January 2026. From February 2026 onward, it fell to **$65K–$75K per month** — a **35% decline** that warrants immediate investigation.\n",
                "\n",
                "**3. 8% of orders never convert to revenue.**\n",
                "Of 50,000 orders, **4,015 were cancelled (4.9%) or returned (3.1%)**. Additionally, payment failure rates are consistent across all methods at **3.6–4.0%**. Combined, roughly **1 in 12 orders** generates no revenue — a significant leakage point.\n",
                "\n",
                "**4. VIP customers underperform their segment.**\n",
                "VIP customers generated only **$288K (9.7%)** of revenue, while Regular customers drove **$1.66M (55.5%)** and New customers **$1.04M (34.8%)**. The VIP segment is not delivering proportionally higher value.\n",
                "\n",
                "**5. Higher discounts reduce average order value.**\n",
                "Orders with 0% discount average **$74.54** per order, while orders with 21%+ discounts average only **$56.06** — a **25% lower AOV**. Discounts are eroding revenue without driving larger basket sizes."
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 27,
            "width": 12,
            "height": 7
          }
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "recommendations",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## Recommendations for the Head of Operations\n",
                "\n",
                "### 1. Investigate the 2026 revenue decline\n",
                "Revenue dropped **35%** from ~$107K/month to ~$65–75K/month starting February 2026. Determine whether this reflects fewer recorded months, a seasonal dip, or a real business downturn. If real, prioritise marketing spend and customer retention campaigns in the affected period.\n",
                "\n",
                "### 2. Reduce cancellations and returns\n",
                "**8% of orders** (4,015) are cancelled or returned, representing significant lost revenue. Set a target to halve this to 4% by improving product descriptions, delivery reliability, and post-purchase support. Even a **1% reduction** would recover an estimated **$30K** in annualised revenue.\n",
                "\n",
                "### 3. Optimise the discount strategy\n",
                "Higher discounts correlate with **lower** average order values ($74.54 at 0% vs $56.06 at 21%+). Discounts are eroding margin without driving larger baskets. Test capping discounts at **10–20%** and measure the impact on both order volume and total revenue. Also review the VIP segment — at 9.7% of revenue, VIP customers are not delivering proportionally higher value and may need targeted retention offers.\n",
                "\n",
                "---\n",
                "\n",
                "### Data Problems Found & Handled\n",
                "\n",
                "| Problem | Count | Decision |\n",
                "| --- | --- | --- |\n",
                "| Duplicate order rows | 120 | Dropped exact duplicates |\n",
                "| Unparseable OrderDates | 35 | Kept rows, excluded from time charts |\n",
                "| Invalid Quantity (≤0 or null) | 105 | Kept rows, revenue set to 0 |\n",
                "| Missing Discount | 220 | Filled with 0 (no discount) |\n",
                "| Missing PaymentMethod | 450 | Labelled 'Unknown' |\n",
                "| Missing City | 119 | Filled with 'Unknown' |\n",
                "| Misspelled cities | 40+ | Standardised (e.g. 'tehran' → 'Tehran', 'Mashad' → 'Mashhad') |\n",
                "| Cancelled/returned orders | 4,015 | Excluded from recognised revenue |\n",
                "| Failed/refunded payments | ~4% | Excluded from recognised revenue |"
              ]
            }
